S,G|               EXT. A HILLOCK WITH TWO HEADBOARDS - MED. CLOSE SHOT -
O|
S|               NIGHT
O|
N|               Nothing stirs and we hear nothing. Then, with faintest little 
N|               rustle, Debbie comes snaking along the ground into the hollow 
N|               between the two graves and lies there face down, pressed 
N|               against Topsy. She becomes one with the earth and the 
N|               stillness. And then the moonlight strikes the tips of the 
N|               scrub growth and as a cloud scuds by, the moonlight reveals 
N,G|               something glittering -- like beads. And the CAMERA from that 
N,G|               ground-level shot
O|
T,G|               RAISES QUICKLY TO:
O|
G|               CLOSE SHOT - FROM EXTREME LOW ANGLE - SCAR
O|
N,I|               The Comanche we are later to know as SCAR is painted for war -- 
N,I|               tall, savage, mockingly looking down at what we know is the 
N|               child's hiding place... And in that instant, from a dozen 
N|               quarters and a dozen throats, sounds the wild yammer of the 
N|               warwhoop!
