S|               MOONLIGHT
O|
C|                                     MARTIN
P|                              (desperately)
U|                         Mose! Wait!...
O|
N|               He goes running, stumbling after the riders -- desperately 
N|               calling to them...
O|
C|                                     MARTIN
U|                         Ethan!... Mose!...
O|
N|               And then at the crest of the rising ground, he stops --
O|
N,G|               We see in the distance the glow of a fire leading from the 
N|               barns and the hayricks and the house of Aaron Edwards.
O|
N|               Martin runs down the slope.
O|
S,G|               EXT. YARD AND APPROACH TO EDWARDS HOUSE - WIDE ANGLE - NIGHT
O|
M|               (NOTE TO W. HOCH: Here again that use of red is suggested.)
