N|               Fog and heavy morning mist rise from the swamp. Some cattails 
N|               in the near ground. The effect is eerie, very still except 
N|               for the trilling of frogs. Then, very quietly, the men emerge 
N|               from the mist swirling around them. They are leading their 
N|               horses. Sam looks baffled, angry. They stand still, listening -- 
N|               then slowly continue.
O|
