P|                              (staring across river)
U|                         Criminy!
O|
S,G|               EXT. RIVER'S EDGE - LONG SHOT - PAST THE GROUP
O|
N,G|               On the opposite bank, we see the full force of Comanches 
N|               riding into sight -- racing their mounts to the edge, then 
N|               wheeling off -- jeering, taunting. Brad starts to bring up 
N|               his rifle.
