O|
S,G|               EXT. THE RIVER - FULL SHOT - INDIAN CHARGE
O|
N|               The Comanches are coming in, crouched low over their ponies' 
N|               necks, whooping and firing. Men and horses go down, counted 
N|               off by the expert marksmanship of the Texans. But they keep 
N|               coming.
O|
O|               77-B
O|
