O|
S,G|               EXT. RIVER'S EDGE - CLOSE SHOT - BEHIND ETHAN
O|
N,G|               The angle is along his rifle barrel as it beads on one of 
N|               the racing Comanches trying to pick up the dead Indian.
O|
N|               Clayton's big hand grasps the rifle barrel.
O|
C|                                     CLAYTON'S VOICE
P|                              (quietly)
U|                         No, Ethan.
O|
