O|
C|                                     CLAYTON
U|                         Let them bury their dead...
O|
N|               Ethan pulls the gun free and looks out across the river.
O|
S,G|               EXT. THE RIVER - LONG SHOT - PAST THEM
O|
N|               The Comanches have done their work, are riding away -- and 
N|               over the saddle of one lies the limp form of the dead Indian.
O|
N|               Ethan looks back at Sam.
O|
C|                                     ETHAN
U|                         That tears it, Reverend... From now 
U|                         on, you keep out...
P|                              (mad now -- facing 
P|                              the others)
