O|
N|               A region of buttes and giant rock formations; treeless, arid 
N,G|               and seemingly reaching out to infinity. Far off we see a 
N|               cloud of dust -- miles and miles off. Only the dust, nothing 
N,G|               else. From behind CAMERA ride the three men -- Ethan, Brad, 
N|               and Martin -- dust-powdered, eyes bloodshot. The three are 
N|               watching that distant cloud of dust. They force their weary 
N|               horses onward.
