O|
N|               It is a simple log-sided room with plank benches without 
N|               backs. Up front is a small box-like pulpit, no altar.
O|
N|               Across the front of the room, set up either on benches or on 
N|               boards over saw-horses are four blanket-covered figures -- 
N|               at least two being the bodies of children.
