N|               golden hair, torn garments. It is she who has been making 
N|               the keening sound, the animal moans. Now she crouches at the 
N|               sight of them and looks desperately for a means of escape. 
N|               Two girls are asleep, heads together and backs to the door. 
N|               One has light hair, like Debbie's; the other brown hair. The 
N|               afternoon sun coming through a high window touches the light 
N|               hair.
