U|                         AND other things... Mebbe you thought 
U|                         you was gettin' away with being 
U|                         comical about that Indian wife you 
U|                         took... I bet she wasn't the first 
U|                         squaw you...
O|
N|               Martin swings wildly but Charlie is a wily fighter. He side-
N|               steps and chops Martin in the jaw and drives him against the 
N|               wall. Laurie runs between them.
O|
