O|
S,G|               INT. JORGENSEN KEEPING ROOM - LATER THAT NIGHT
O|
N,I|               The last of the wedding guests is leaving: Ed Nesby carrying 
N,I|               his bull fiddle and with his wife and daughter and two smaller 
N,I|               children preceding him out the door.
O|
