N|               wedding debacle. Charlie MacCorry is sitting dejectedly, 
N|               studying a spot on the floor. Ethan is at the mantel. Laurie 
N|               is in her room -- presumably changing out of her wedding 
N|               gown. Martin is at a sink, bathing a cut on his lip. Clayton, 
N|               still in his clerical coat, is near the door.
O|
